{"id":333,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Since Swablu looks like a cumulus cloud, foes can have a hard time finding it. Apparently its wings turned white over many generations."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Its cottony wings are full of air, making them light and fluffy to the touch. Swablu takes diligent care of its wings."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Swablu loves to make things clean. If it spots something dirty, it will wipe and polish it with its cottony wings. If its wings become dirty, this Pokémon finds a stream and showers itself."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Swablu has light and fluffy wings that are like cottony clouds. This Pokémon is not frightened of people. It lands on the heads of people and sits there like a cotton-fluff hat."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someone’s head, it looks like a cotton hat."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that has wings like cottony clouds. After enduring winter, in which little food is available, SWABLU flocks move closer to towns in the spring."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Natural Cure","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's status conditions are cured when it switches out."},{"name":"Cloud Nine","hidden":true,"description":"Eliminates the effects of weather."}],"eggGroups":["Flying","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"erratic","habitat"